    "long_instructions": "## **Reflect on the Bug**\r\n\r\n> ##### Explain how you found and fixed the problem.\r\n>\r\n> * The bug I experienced was ___\r\n> * My guess was ___\r\n> * AI suggested ___\r\n> * The correct fix was ___\r\n> * This happened because ___\r\n",
